Schematically, the contrast is $\begin{aligned}
\text{first attempt} &\Longrightarrow \text{repetition} + \text{filler} + \text{weak linkage},\\
\text{continued reps} &\Longrightarrow \text{clearer transfer}.\end{aligned}$ Or in the lecture’s more general pedagogical form, $\text{start poorly} \Longrightarrow \text{eventual fluency}.$

